  "body": "### What problem are you trying to solve?\n\nPlease refer to discussion on https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/13006 where cross-origin isolated capability and time origin were added to worklets.  That PR was a minimal change to support changes in the hr-time and web-audio specifications, so the crossOriginIsolated property was not specified to be directly accessible on all worklets.\n\nSince the capability is added to the global object it is strange that it's not directly exposed, so we should consider exposing it.\n\n### What solutions exist today?\n\nNone.\n\n### How would you solve it?\n\nComment [here](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/13006#issuecomment-6042961195) notes that we don't have a `WindowOrWorkerOrWorkletGlobalScope` mixin, so it may be best to expose the property directly on Worklet.\n\n### Anything else?\n\nI don't have time right now to drive this myself, but I was asked to file this issue so the idea isn't lost.  Thank you for your consideration.",
